{"id":"20260829T004552.532264679Z-064d64a0","time":"2026-08-29T00:45:52.532264679Z","session_id":"session-20260829T003802.236153648Z","task_id":"task-1787963882236621025","source":"reviewer","kind":"output","summary":"{\"decision\":\"revise\",\"summary\":\"The initial scope check is correctly placed for the worker-produced diff, but it does not confine the final candidate: validation formatters may rewrite the worktree and e.validate re-reads a different diff before audit, classification, review, or admission. Sensei's authoritative preflight names the critical invariant “Shared context explains why a change was asked for and never enlarges what may be changed”; this remaining rewrite path violates that bound despite green checks.\",\"instructions\":\"Keep the pre-validation check, and add the same confinement check immediately after e.validate returns its re-read diff and before ValidationRun is emitted or any prospective/test inspection, audit, classification, review, or admission occurs. Add a behavioral engine test in which a configured formatter creates or modifies an unplanned path; it must refuse that final diff and prove no audit or review is reached.\",\"findings\":[{\"id\":\"f1\",\"severity\":\"blocking\",\"claim\":\"The candidate asserts that nothing downstream can see a wider change after confineToPlannedFiles runs before e.validate.\",\"reference\":\"internal/workflow/engine.go: confineToPlannedFiles call before e.validate; e.validate at lines 4341-4402\",\"reason\":\"e.validate explicitly runs mutating formatter checks first, then calls CandidateDiff and returns the re-read diff. A formatter can add or alter an unplanned path after the sole confinement check. The subsequent audit, Level-1 classification, reviewer, and admission consume that final wider diff without another scope refusal. The supplied structural test proves only placement before validation, not confinement of the candidate actually reviewed.\",\"correction\":\"Re-check confineToPlannedFiles(diff, tc.Files) on the diff returned by e.validate, before emitting validation evidence or invoking downstream stages. Preserve the existing pre-validation check as well.\",\"proof_gap\":\"No test configures a formatter that widens the diff and proves the post-format candidate is refused before audit/review.\"}]}","payload":{"stream":"stderr"}}
