es scope not be enlarged, but does not grant authority to add this separate workflow behavior.\",\"correction\":\"Delete the second post-validation check and TestAFormatterCannotWidenTheCandidateAfterValidation, including imports used only by that test. Keep the single planned pre-validation check and the four specified tests.\",\"proof_gap\":\"There is no revised architect decision or plan authorizing the formatter-induced post-validation refusal.\"}]}","payload":{"stream":"stderr"}}
